 msgid "### GLM-5.2 SFA DCP replicated indexer"
 msgstr "### GLM-5.2 SFA DCP复制索引器"
 
+msgid "### SFA DSA-CP `o_proj` Path"
+msgstr "### SFA DSA-CP `o_proj`路径"
+
+msgid "## Related Files"
+msgstr "## 相关文件"
+
+msgid "# Context Parallel"
+msgstr "# 上下文并行"
+
 msgid ""
-"GLM-5.2 uses Sparse Flash Attention (SFA) with a LightningIndexer. For DCP,\n"
-"the indexer needs a full-sequence view to select the same sparse top-k blocks\n"
-"as non-DCP SFA, while the much larger SFA KV cache should remain sharded to\n"
-"retain DCP's memory benefit:"
+"The context parallel features include Prefill Context Parallel (PCP), Decode"
+" Context Parallel (DCP), and DSA-CP."
+msgstr "上下文并行特性包括预填充上下文并行（PCP）、解码上下文并行（DCP）以及 DSA-CP。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prefill Context Parallel is supported with ModelRunner V2 "
+"(`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`). It splits prefill tokens across additional "
+"ranks to reduce time to first token. See the [Context Parallel "
+"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md#prefill-context-"
+"parallel) for PCP configuration, supported feature combinations, and "
+"constraints."
 msgstr ""
-"GLM-5.2使用带有LightningIndexer的稀疏Flash注意力（SFA）。对于DCP，索引器需要完整的序列视图来选择与非DCP "
-"SFA相同的稀疏top-k块，而更大的SFA KV缓存应保持分片以保留DCP的内存优势："
+"预填充上下文并行在 ModelRunner V2（`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1`）下受支持。它将预填充 token "
+"拆分到额外的 rank 上，以减少首 token 时延。有关 PCP "
+"配置、支持的特性组合和约束，请参阅[上下文并行指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md#prefill-"
+"context-parallel)。"
 
 msgid ""
-"- The LightningIndexer cache is replicated on every DCP rank, so index\n"
-"  selection uses the complete sequence.\n"
-"- The SFA KV cache remains DCP-local. Global indices from the replicated\n"
-"  indexer view are remapped to local KV indices before SFA runs.\n"
-"- During prefill or a mixed batch, only KV blocks referenced by the sparse\n"
-"  block table are compacted and all-gathered after the current layer writes its\n"
-"  KV cache.\n"
-"- Decode-only batches retain the DCP SFA Q-gather and result-merge path."
+"Decode Context Parallel shards the KV cache along the sequence dimension "
+"across ranks in a DCP group, which may reuse TP ranks, PCP ranks, or both. "
+"It eliminates redundant KV-cache storage without adding devices to the "
+"process world."
+msgstr ""
+"解码上下文并行在 DCP 组内的各个 rank 之间沿序列维度对 KV cache 进行分片，这些 rank 可以复用 TP rank、PCP rank"
+" 或两者。它消除了冗余的 KV cache 存储，而无需向进程 world 中添加设备。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This document describes PCP execution, DCP cache sharding, and the separate "
+"DSA-CP sparse-attention path. PCP uses ModelRunner V2 (MRV2); DCP is "
+"available in both MRV1 and MRV2. See the [MRV2 PCP/DCP "
+"RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12622) for the "
+"design rationale."
+msgstr ""
+"本文档介绍 PCP 执行、DCP cache 分片以及独立的 DSA-CP 稀疏注意力路径。PCP 使用 ModelRunner "
+"V2（MRV2）；DCP 在 MRV1 和 MRV2 中均可用。有关设计原理，请参阅 [MRV2 PCP/DCP "
+"RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12622)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"DCP stores tokens in an interleaved layout across ranks. The interleaving "
+"granularity is controlled by `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size`, whose declared "
+"default is `1`."
+msgstr ""
+"DCP 以交错布局在各个 rank 之间存储 token。交错粒度由 `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` 控制，其声明的默认值为"
+" `1`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"SFA+DCP uses `block_size` as the effective interleave size; when KV transfer"
+" is enabled, set it explicitly to `block_size` to avoid a configuration "
+"error."
+msgstr ""
+"SFA+DCP 使用 `block_size` 作为有效的交错大小；当启用 KV 传输时，请将其显式设置为 `block_size`，以避免配置错误。"
+
+msgid ""
+"PCP adds compute ranks but does not multiply the virtual block size. With "
+"DCP=1, each PCP rank retains the full sequence for its TP-local KV heads. "
+"With DCP enabled, only the owner of a token position writes its slot; other "
+"ranks and padding entries receive `PAD_SLOT_ID` (`-1`) and are excluded from"
+" cache writes."
+msgstr ""
+"PCP 增加了计算 rank，但不会使虚拟 block 大小成倍增加。当 DCP=1 时，每个 PCP rank 为其 TP 本地的 KV head "
+"保留完整序列。启用 DCP 时，只有某个 token 位置的所有者才会写入其 slot；其他 rank 和 padding 条目会收到 "
+"`PAD_SLOT_ID`（`-1`），并被排除在 cache 写入之外。"
+
+msgid ""
+"PCP synchronizes cache data or cache-update inputs before attention. The "
+"exchange point depends on the backend. Sparse indexer and compressor state "
+"have their own layouts, separate from DCP-sharded attention storage."
+msgstr ""
+"PCP 在注意力计算之前同步 cache 数据或 cache 更新输入。交换点取决于后端。稀疏 indexer 和 compressor "
+"状态有其自己的布局，与 DCP 分片的注意力存储相互独立。"
+
+msgid "## PCP execution"
+msgstr "## PCP 执行"
+
+msgid "### Parallel topology"
+msgstr "### 并行拓扑"
+
+msgid ""
+"The model-worker count across a configured DP deployment is `DP * PP * PCP *"
+" TP`. Within one DP replica and PP stage, the TP×PCP grid contains `TP * "
+"PCP` workers. DCP reuses these workers."
+msgstr ""
+"在配置了 DP 的部署中，model worker 的数量为 `DP * PP * PCP * TP`。在一个 DP 副本和 PP stage "
+"内，TP×PCP 网格包含 `TP * PCP` 个 worker。DCP 复用这些 worker。"
+
+msgid "For TP=2 and PCP=2:"
+msgstr "对于 TP=2 和 PCP=2："
+
+msgid "| PCP coordinate | TP coordinate 0 | TP coordinate 1 |"
+msgstr "| PCP 坐标 | TP 坐标 0 | TP 坐标 1 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"TP groups follow the table's rows: `[0, 1]` and `[2, 3]`. PCP groups follow "
+"its columns: `[0, 2]` and `[1, 3]`. DCP can span the PCP axis or the full "
+"grid:"
+msgstr ""
+"TP 组沿表的行分布：`[0, 1]` 和 `[2, 3]`。PCP 组沿表的列分布：`[0, 2]` 和 `[1, 3]`。DCP 可以跨越 PCP "
+"轴或整个网格："
+
+msgid "| Configuration | Logical DCP groups | Query heads within a group |"
+msgstr "| 配置 | 逻辑 DCP 组 | 组内的 Query head |"
+
+msgid "| DCP=1 | Single-rank groups | No sequence sharding |"
+msgstr "| DCP=1 | 单 rank 组 | 无序列分片 |"
+
+msgid "| DCP=PCP=2 | `[0, 2]`, `[1, 3]` | Same TP-local heads |"
+msgstr "| DCP=PCP=2 | `[0, 2]`、`[1, 3]` | 相同的 TP 本地 head |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| DCP=TP*PCP=4 | `[0, 2, 1, 3]` | Includes distinct TP head partitions |"
+msgstr "| DCP=TP*PCP=4 | `[0, 2, 1, 3]` | 包含不同的 TP head 分区 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"The lists follow logical DCP rank order: the PCP coordinate varies first, "
+"then the TP coordinate."
+msgstr "这些列表遵循逻辑 DCP rank 顺序：PCP 坐标先变化，然后是 TP 坐标。"
+
+msgid ""
+"MLA and SFA implement both stacked layouts; GQA/MQA stacking requires "
+"`DCP=PCP`. DSA and DSA V4.1 PCP use replicated caches, with DCP stacking "
+"outside their documented PCP configuration. With PCP=1, DCP groups lie "
+"within TP: MLA requires `TP % DCP == 0`, sparse SFA requires `DCP == TP` "
+"when DCP is enabled, and GQA has additional KV-head constraints. Deployment "
+"constraints are listed in the [Context Parallel user "
+"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"MLA 和 SFA 实现了两种堆叠布局；GQA/MQA 堆叠要求 `DCP=PCP`。DSA 和 DSA V4.1 PCP 使用复制的 cache，其 "
+"DCP 堆叠超出了它们所记录的 PCP 配置范围。当 PCP=1 时，DCP 组位于 TP 内：MLA 要求 `TP % DCP == 0`，稀疏 "
+"SFA 在启用 DCP 时要求 `DCP == TP`，而 GQA 有额外的 KV head "
+"约束。部署约束列在[上下文并行用户指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md)中。"
+
+msgid "### Batch lifecycle"
+msgstr "### Batch 生命周期"
+
+msgid ""
+"The scheduler retains a global batch. Upstream `PCPManager` partitions each "
+"worker step into local virtual request rows and records how to restore "
+"global token order. `AscendPCPManager` adapts this lifecycle for Ascend "
+"buffers, attention metadata, graph padding, and decode-request assignment."
+msgstr ""
+"调度器保留一个全局 batch。上游 `PCPManager` 将每个 worker step 划分为本地虚拟请求行，并记录如何恢复全局 token "
+"顺序。`AscendPCPManager` 针对昇腾 buffer、注意力元数据、图 padding 和解码请求分配对这一生命周期进行了适配。"
+
+msgid "#### Prefill: head-tail partitioning"
+msgstr "#### 预填充：头尾分区"
+
+msgid ""
+"Causal attention gives later queries more preceding tokens to attend to. PCP"
+" balances this work using a head-tail partition, also called DualChunkSwap. "
+"For `L` scheduled query tokens and PCP size `P`, the request is divided into"
+" `2 * P` chunks of up to `ceil(L / (2 * P))` tokens. Rank `r` receives "
+"chunks `r` and `2 * P - 1 - r`. For P=4:"
+msgstr ""
+"因果注意力使靠后的 query 有更多前置 token 可供关注。PCP 使用头尾分区（也称为 DualChunkSwap）来平衡这一工作。对于 `L`"
+" 个已调度的 query token 和 PCP 大小 `P`，请求被划分为 `2 * P` 个 chunk，每个 chunk 最多包含 `ceil(L"
+" / (2 * P))` 个 token。Rank `r` 接收 chunk `r` 和 `2 * P - 1 - r`。对于 P=4："
+
+msgid ""
+"Each fragment keeps its original positions and computed-prefix length, so "
+"tail queries can attend to earlier chunks. Local buffers are padded for "
+"collectives. Short requests can leave PCP-only ranks without queries; the "
+"PCP+DCP path replicates short prefills when splitting would leave an empty "
+"chunk."
+msgstr ""
+"每个片段保留其原始位置和已计算的 prefix 长度，因此尾部 query 可以关注较早的 chunk。本地 buffer 会为集合通信进行 "
+"padding。较短的请求可能导致仅 PCP 的 rank 没有 query；当拆分会导致某个 chunk 为空时，PCP+DCP "
+"路径会复制较短的预填充。"
+
+msgid "#### Decode: request ownership and cache shards"
+msgstr "#### 解码：请求所有权与 cache 分片"
+
+msgid ""
+"With `PCP > 1` and `DCP == 1`, scheduled decode requests are assigned round-"
+"robin to PCP ranks. Each request's queries, including fixed-length "
+"speculative verification, stay with one owner for the step. Cache updates "
+"are synchronized across PCP, allowing ownership to change on subsequent "
+"steps. Ranks without queries still participate in the required collectives."
+msgstr ""
+"当 `PCP > 1` 且 `DCP == 1` 时，已调度的解码请求以轮询方式分配给 PCP rank。每个请求的 "
+"query（包括固定长度的投机验证）在该 step 内归属于同一个所有者。Cache 更新在 PCP 之间同步，允许所有权在后续 step "
+"中发生变化。没有 query 的 rank 仍参与所需的集合通信。"
+
+msgid ""
+"With PCP and DCP stacked, decode requests are replicated across PCP ranks. "
+"Each rank attends to its local DCP KV shard, then contributes its partial "
+"output and softmax statistics to the result merge."
+msgstr ""
+"当 PCP 和 DCP 堆叠时，解码请求会在各个 PCP rank 之间复制。每个 rank 关注其本地的 DCP KV 分片，然后将其部分输出和 "
+"softmax 统计量贡献给结果合并。"
+
+msgid "#### Restoring global order"
+msgstr "#### 恢复全局顺序"
+
+msgid ""
+"Attention metadata distinguishes global request order, local query order, "
+"and gathered KV order. `AscendPCPAttentionContext` carries the global view "
+"and the maps connecting these layouts. Gathered hidden states are restored "
+"to global token order at the runner boundary for sampling and supported "
+"draft-model processing."
 msgstr ""
-"- LightningIndexer缓存在每个DCP rank上复制，因此索引选择使用完整的序列。\n"
-"- SFA KV缓存保持DCP本地。来自复制索引器视图的全局索引在SFA运行之前被重新映射到本地KV索引。\n"
-"- 在预填充或混合批次期间，只有稀疏块表引用的KV块在当前层写入其KV缓存后被压缩并全收集。\n"
-"- 仅解码批次保留DCP SFA Q收集和结果合并路径。"
+"注意力元数据区分全局请求顺序、本地 query 顺序和收集后的 KV 顺序。`AscendPCPAttentionContext` "
+"携带全局视图以及连接这些布局的映射。收集到的 hidden state 在 runner 边界处恢复为全局 token 顺序，用于采样和受支持的 "
+"draft model 处理。"
 
 msgid ""
-"This mode is selected automatically for SFA sparse models when\n"
-"`prefill_context_parallel_size=1` and `decode_context_parallel_size>1`. It\n"
-"requires `decode_context_parallel_size == tensor_parallel_size`."
+"DCP is implemented as a specialization of the corresponding v1 attention "
+"backend rather than as a parallel copy of it:"
+msgstr "DCP 是作为相应 v1 注意力后端的特化实现，而非其并行副本："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `DCPMetadataBuilderMixin` owns DCP group/rank discovery and access to the per-rank context-length matrix.\n"
+"- `DCPImplMixin` owns DCP collectives and the common partial-output/LSE merge.\n"
+"- GQA, MLA, and SFA DCP builders inherit their v1 metadata builders. They only add DCP metadata fields or temporarily expose the DCP-specific cache view.\n"
+"- GQA, MLA, and SFA DCP implementations inherit their v1 implementations and override only the kernel stages whose communication or cache layout differs."
 msgstr ""
-"当`prefill_context_parallel_size=1`且`decode_context_parallel_size>1`时，此模式会自动为SFA稀疏模型选择。它要求`decode_context_parallel_size"
-" == tensor_parallel_size`。"
+"- `DCPMetadataBuilderMixin` 负责 DCP 组/rank 发现以及对每个 rank 上下文长度矩阵的访问。\n"
+"- `DCPImplMixin` 负责 DCP 集合通信以及通用的部分输出/LSE 合并。\n"
+"- GQA、MLA 和 SFA 的 DCP 构建器继承其 v1 元数据构建器。它们仅添加 DCP 元数据字段，或临时暴露 DCP 专用的缓存视图。\n"
+"- GQA、MLA 和 SFA 的 DCP 实现继承其 v1 实现，仅重写通信或缓存布局不同的 kernel 阶段。"
 
 msgid ""
-"The replicated indexer increases indexer-cache memory in proportion to the\n"
+"The normal v1 builders remain the source of truth for request "
+"classification, padding, masks, graph metadata, and common KV-cache "
+"metadata. DCP-specific metadata is kept out of the normal v1 metadata "
+"schemas."
+msgstr ""
+"常规的 v1 构建器仍然是请求分类、padding、掩码、图元数据以及通用 KV 缓存元数据的唯一权威来源。DCP 专用元数据不会纳入常规 v1 元数据"
+" schema。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For PCP, `AscendPCPAttentionContext` supplies the global request view and "
+"restore maps to the backend metadata builders. The same local-query/global-"
+"cache distinction applies when PCP is stacked with DCP."
+msgstr ""
+"对于 PCP，`AscendPCPAttentionContext` 向后端元数据构建器提供全局请求视图和恢复映射。当 PCP 与 DCP "
+"叠加使用时，同样适用本地查询/全局缓存的区分。"
+
+msgid ""
+"PCP-only GQA and MLA gather current K/V or latent KV for cache insertion "
+"while computing local queries. With PCP+DCP, GQA maps merged history results"
+" back to local query fragments and combines them with attention over "
+"current-token causal prefixes. MLA gathers history KV in bounded chunks; "
+"senders derive a shared plan from the global batch so differing local "
+"fragment lengths produce matching collective sizes."
+msgstr ""
+"仅使用 PCP 时，GQA 和 MLA 在计算本地查询的同时，收集当前 K/V 或 latent KV 以插入缓存。在 PCP+DCP 下，GQA "
+"将合并后的历史结果映射回本地查询片段，并将其与当前 token 因果前缀上的注意力相结合。MLA 以有界分块方式收集历史 KV；发送方从全局 batch"
+" 推导出共享计划，从而使不同的本地片段长度产生匹配的集合通信大小。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Causal multi-token decode can evaluate history and current tokens "
+"separately, then combine their results with LSE. This preserves current-"
+"token causality while history remains DCP-sharded."
+msgstr ""
+"因果多 token 解码可以分别计算历史和当前 token，然后使用 LSE 合并它们的结果。这样既保持了当前 token 的因果性，又使历史保持 "
+"DCP 分片。"
+
+msgid "### Combining DCP results"
+msgstr "### 合并 DCP 结果"
+
+msgid ""
+"For a query/head, shard `j` returns normalized attention output `O_j` and "
+"log-sum-exp `L_j`. The complete result uses their softmax weights:"
+msgstr "对于某个查询/头，分片 `j` 返回归一化的注意力输出 `O_j` 和对数和指数 `L_j`。完整结果使用它们的 softmax 权重："
+
+msgid ""
+"With DCP=PCP, Q heads are already identical within the group. The shared "
+"merge path gathers partial output/LSE contributions across PCP. With "
+"DCP=TP*PCP, distinct Q heads are first gathered across TP; the output "
+"exchange then combines TP and PCP contributions and restores the TP-local "
+"head range. TP-only DCP exchanges contributions within its DCP group. Common"
+" operations are implemented by `DCPImplMixin` and `dcp_a2a_fused`."
+msgstr ""
+"当 DCP=PCP 时，Q 头在组内已经相同。共享合并路径跨 PCP 收集部分输出/LSE 贡献。当 DCP=TP*PCP 时，不同的 Q 头首先跨 "
+"TP 收集；随后输出交换合并 TP 和 PCP 的贡献，并恢复 TP 本地的头范围。仅 TP 的 DCP 在其 DCP 组内交换贡献。通用操作由 "
+"`DCPImplMixin` 和 `dcp_a2a_fused` 实现。"
+
+msgid ""
+"GLM-5.2 uses Sparse Flash Attention (SFA) with a LightningIndexer. For DCP, "
+"the indexer needs a full-sequence view to select the same sparse top-k "
+"blocks as non-DCP SFA, while the much larger SFA KV cache should remain "
+"sharded to retain DCP's memory benefit:"
+msgstr ""
+"GLM-5.2 使用带有 LightningIndexer 的稀疏 Flash Attention（SFA）。对于 DCP，indexer "
+"需要全序列视图，以选择与非 DCP SFA 相同的稀疏 top-k 块，而大得多的 SFA KV 缓存应保持分片，以保留 DCP 的内存优势："
+
+msgid ""
+"- The LightningIndexer cache is replicated on every DCP rank, so index selection uses the complete sequence.\n"
+"- The SFA KV cache remains DCP-local. Global indices from the replicated indexer view are remapped to local KV indices before SFA runs.\n"
+"- During prefill or a mixed batch, only KV blocks referenced by the sparse block table are compacted and all-gathered after the current layer writes its KV cache.\n"
+"- Decode-only batches retain the DCP SFA Q-gather and result-merge path."
+msgstr ""
+"- LightningIndexer 缓存在每个 DCP rank 上复制，因此索引选择使用完整序列。\n"
+"- SFA KV 缓存保持 DCP 本地。在 SFA 运行之前，来自复制的 indexer 视图的全局索引会重新映射为本地 KV 索引。\n"
+"- 在 prefill 或混合 batch 期间，仅压缩稀疏块表引用的 KV 块，并在当前层写入其 KV 缓存后进行 all-gather。\n"
+"- 仅解码的 batch 保留 DCP SFA 的 Q 收集和结果合并路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This mode is selected automatically for sparse SFA models when DCP is "
+"enabled (`decode_context_parallel_size>1`)."
+msgstr "当启用 DCP（`decode_context_parallel_size>1`）时，稀疏 SFA 模型会自动选择此模式。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For a GLM-5.2 DCP deployment, keep `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` equal to "
+"the KV-cache block size:"
+msgstr "对于 GLM-5.2 DCP 部署，请保持 `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` 等于 KV 缓存块大小："
+
+msgid ""
+"The replicated indexer increases indexer-cache memory in proportion to the "
 "DCP world size; the SFA KV cache itself remains sharded."
-msgstr "复制索引器会按DCP世界大小的比例增加索引器缓存内存；SFA KV缓存本身保持分片。"
+msgstr "复制的 indexer 会使 indexer 缓存内存按 DCP world size 成比例增加；SFA KV 缓存本身保持分片。"
 
-msgid "### SFA DSA-CP `o_proj` Path"
-msgstr "### SFA DSA-CP `o_proj`路径"
+msgid ""
+"With PCP+DCP, the compact block-table plan is derived from the global "
+"request view. SFA PCP supports both KV-input gathering and fused prologs. A "
+"fused prolog first writes local cache rows; those rows are packed, gathered,"
+" and written to receiving caches. Indexer updates are synchronized "
+"separately."
+msgstr ""
+"在 PCP+DCP 下，紧凑块表计划从全局请求视图推导得出。SFA PCP 同时支持 KV 输入收集和融合 prolog。融合 prolog "
+"首先写入本地缓存行；这些行被打包、收集，并写入接收方缓存。Indexer 更新单独同步。"
 
 msgid ""
-"SFA DSA-CP execution intentionally reuses the normal TP-sharded `o_proj`.\n"
-"This applies both to a mixed-role instance and to a PD-disaggregated P node; it is not a standalone user-facing `o_proj` TP switch.\n"
-"The runtime path supports two layouts:"
+"DSA-CP requires ModelRunner V1; set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` before "
+"enabling `enable_dsa_cp`."
 msgstr ""
-"SFA DSA-CP执行有意复用常规TP分片的`o_proj`。这既适用于混合角色实例，也适用于PD分离的P节点；它不是独立的面向用户的`o_proj`"
-" TP开关。运行时路径支持两种布局："
+"DSA-CP 需要 ModelRunner V1；在启用 `enable_dsa_cp` 之前，请设置 "
+"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"SFA DSA-CP adapts the output projection to the attention output layout while"
+" retaining TP-sharded weights:"
+msgstr "SFA DSA-CP 使输出投影适配注意力输出布局，同时保留 TP 分片权重："
 
 msgid ""
-"- **Decode-only batches** keep the decode TP path.\n"
-"  SFA outputs are exchanged with an all-to-all in the TP group, then the original TP-sharded `o_proj` runs normally.\n"
-"- **Prefill or mixed batches**, including batches on a PD-disaggregated P node, produce SFA outputs that are not directly compatible with the TP-sharded `o_proj` input layout.\n"
-"  Before `o_proj` forward, each rank all-gathers the TP-sharded `o_proj` weight and all input-sharded quantization parameters into temporary full-weight buffers.\n"
-"  The full-weight `o_proj` forward runs once for that batch, and the module is then restored to the TP parameter aliases."
+"- **Decode-only batches** exchange attention outputs across TP ranks to reuse the standard TP projection.\n"
+"- **Prefill or mixed batches** temporarily gather the projection weights so each rank can project its local tokens. This also applies to a prefill node in P/D disaggregation."
 msgstr ""
-"- **仅解码批次**保留解码TP路径。\n"
-"  SFA输出在TP组中通过all-to-all交换，然后原始的TP分片`o_proj`正常运行。\n"
-"- **预填充或混合批次**，包括PD分离P节点上的批次，产生的SFA输出与TP分片的`o_proj`输入布局不直接兼容。\n"
-"  在`o_proj`前向传播之前，每个rank将TP分片的`o_proj`权重和所有输入分片的量化参数全收集到临时全权重缓冲区中。\n"
-"  全权重`o_proj`前向传播对该批次运行一次，然后模块恢复到TP参数别名。"
+"- **仅解码的 batch** 跨 TP rank 交换注意力输出，以复用标准 TP 投影。\n"
+"- **Prefill 或混合 batch** 临时收集投影权重，以便每个 rank 可以投影其本地 token。这也适用于 P/D 分离中的 prefill 节点。"
 
 msgid ""
-"This coupling preserves the existing decode TP behavior, supports "
-"prefill/mixed DSA-CP batches on both mixed-role and P-only instances, and "
-"avoids a persistent full-weight copy on every TP rank."
-msgstr "这种耦合保留了现有的解码TP行为，支持混合角色和仅P实例上的预填充/混合DSA-CP批次，并避免在每个TP rank上持久化全权重副本。"
+"Weights remain persistently TP-sharded; full-weight views are temporary. "
+"This supports token-parallel prefill while preserving the decode projection "
+"strategy and limiting persistent weight memory."
+msgstr "权重始终保持 TP 分片；全权重视图是临时的。这支持 token 并行 prefill，同时保留解码投影策略并限制持久权重内存。"
 
-msgid "## Related Files"
-msgstr "## 相关文件"
+msgid "### DSA and DSA V4.1 PCP"
+msgstr "### DSA 与 DSA V4.1 PCP"
 
 msgid ""
-"- Slot mapping: `vllm_ascend/worker/block_table.py`\n"
-"- Input and attention metadata: `vllm_ascend/worker/model_runner_v1.py`\n"
-"- Shared DCP backend capabilities: `vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/common_cp.py`\n"
-"- GQA DCP backend: `vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/attention_cp.py`\n"
-"- MLA DCP backend: `vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/mla_cp.py`\n"
-"- SFA DCP backend: `vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/sfa_cp.py`\n"
-"- DSA-CP backend: `vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/dsa_cp.py`"
+"DSA PCP gathers hidden states and restores global order for cache updates, "
+"compression, and indexing. Attention then evaluates local query rows. DSA "
+"V4.1 follows the same local-query/global-cache structure with its sliding-"
+"window and compressor state, using backend-specific metadata."
 msgstr ""
-"- 槽位映射：`vllm_ascend/worker/block_table.py`\n"
-"- 输入和注意力元数据：`vllm_ascend/worker/model_runner_v1.py`\n"
-"- 共享DCP后端能力：`vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/common_cp.py`\n"
-"- GQA DCP后端：`vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/attention_cp.py`\n"
-"- MLA DCP后端：`vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/mla_cp.py`\n"
-"- SFA DCP后端：`vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/sfa_cp.py`\n"
-"- DSA-CP后端：`vllm_ascend/attention/context_parallel/dsa_cp.py`"
+"DSA PCP 收集隐藏状态并恢复全局顺序，以用于缓存更新、压缩和索引。随后注意力计算本地查询行。DSA V4.1 "
+"遵循相同的本地查询/全局缓存结构，并带有其滑动窗口和压缩器状态，使用后端专用元数据。"
 
-msgid "# Context Parallel"
-msgstr "# 上下文并行"
+msgid "## Integration with other features"
+msgstr "## 与其他特性的集成"
 
 msgid ""
-"The context parallel features include Decode Context Parallel (DCP) and DSA-"
-"CP."
-msgstr "上下文并行功能包括解码上下文并行（DCP）和DSA-CP。"
+"- **Weight sharding:** Embedding and LM-head weights can be partitioned across TP×PCP. Supported SFA/DSA O-projections also use PCP weight shards: prefill can gather weights temporarily, while sharded decode exchanges activations and returns projected results to their owners. See the [PCP weight-sharding configuration](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md#usage) for the embedding, LM-head, and O-projection options.\n"
+"- **Graph execution:** Local execution sizes and global batch metadata coexist. Input, slot, and restore buffers keep stable addresses across replay, and capture metadata must describe the runtime layouts. See [ACL Graph](ACL_Graph.md) for replay mechanisms and the CP user guide for supported modes.\n"
+"- **Speculative decoding:** The target uses its PCP topology; supported draft paths run with logical PCP=1 on each peer. Target outputs are restored for draft processing and sampling. Draft DCP support remains model-specific.\n"
+"- **KV transfer:** In the documented PCP P/D setup, the producer uses PCP and the consumer uses PCP=1. For standalone DCP and PCP+DCP, KV transfer requires `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` to be set explicitly to the cache block size."
+msgstr ""
+"- **权重分片：** Embedding 和 LM-head 权重可以跨 TP×PCP 进行分区。支持的 SFA/DSA O-projection 也使用 PCP 权重分片：prefill 可以临时收集权重，而分片 decode 则交换激活值并将投影结果返回给其所有者。有关 embedding、LM-head 和 O-projection 的选项，请参阅 [PCP 权重分片配置](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md#usage)。\n"
+"- **图执行：** 本地执行大小和全局批次元数据共存。输入、slot 和恢复缓冲区在重放过程中保持稳定的地址，捕获元数据必须描述运行时布局。有关重放机制，请参阅 [ACL Graph](ACL_Graph.md)，有关支持的模式，请参阅 CP 用户指南。\n"
+"- **投机推理：** 目标使用其 PCP 拓扑；支持的 draft 路径在每个 peer 上以逻辑 PCP=1 运行。目标输出会被恢复以用于 draft 处理和采样。Draft DCP 支持仍因模型而异。\n"
+"- **KV 传输：** 在文档所述的 PCP P/D 设置中，生产者使用 PCP，消费者使用 PCP=1。对于独立 DCP 和 PCP+DCP，KV 传输要求将 `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` 显式设置为缓存块大小。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Configuration and connector compatibility are listed in the [Context "
+"Parallel user guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"配置和连接器兼容性列在 [Context Parallel "
+"用户指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/context_parallel.md) 中。"
 
