+
+msgid ""
+"The restore and save composite actions own the fixed OBS transport\n"
+"configuration. The cache engine has no storage API or credential knowledge."
+msgstr "restore 和 save 复合 action 负责固定的 OBS 传输配置。缓存引擎不具备存储 API 或凭据相关的知识。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Ordinary local source builds use the same action cache in the repository's\n"
+"ignored `csrc/build_cache` directory. This is local-only acceleration: no OBS\n"
+"credentials or remote snapshot transport are involved. Set\n"
+"`VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` to an absolute path to override this local\n"
+"default. CI uses the same workspace-relative `csrc/build_cache` transport\n"
+"path, which the restore helper resolves to an absolute directory for builds.\n"
+"Deleting the local directory causes a cold build;\n"
+"it does not change the compiled source or CI's persistent snapshot."
+msgstr ""
+"普通的本地源码构建使用仓库中被忽略的 `csrc/build_cache` 目录下的同一 action 缓存。这只是本地加速：不涉及 OBS "
+"凭据或远程快照传输。将 `VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR` 设置为绝对路径可覆盖此本地默认值。CI 使用相同的相对于工作区的 "
+"`csrc/build_cache` 传输路径，restore "
+"辅助程序会将其解析为用于构建的绝对目录。删除本地目录会导致冷构建；它不会改变编译后的源码或 CI 的持久化快照。"
+
+msgid ""
+"All L1 producers and consumers must pass the same literal relative\n"
+"`cache-dir: csrc/build_cache` to the restore/save actions. `runs-on/cache`\n"
+"includes that path in its remote cache version: using `/tmp` on one runner\n"
+"and `runner.temp` on another separates otherwise compatible keys into\n"
+"different OBS namespaces. The relative archive layout also restores under\n"
+"each consumer's own workspace, not the producer's absolute directory.\n"
+"The producer initially sets `VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR=csrc/build_cache`.\n"
+"Restore exports its absolute equivalent through `GITHUB_ENV` for compilation\n"
+"and preserves the original spelling in its `cache-dir` output. Save consumes\n"
+"that output, not the updated environment variable: using the absolute build\n"
+"directory as the save input would split the OBS namespace again.\n"
+"Restore/save transport failures remain nonfatal; ordinary source compilation\n"
+"is still the fallback. Existing snapshots under the old path namespaces are\n"
+"not migrated, so the first build with the shared path may be cold."
+msgstr ""
+"所有 L1 生产者和消费者都必须向 restore/save action 传递相同的字面相对路径 `cache-dir: "
+"csrc/build_cache`。`runs-on/cache` 会在其远程缓存版本中包含该路径：在一个 runner 上使用 `/tmp`、在另一个"
+" runner 上使用 `runner.temp`，会将原本兼容的键分隔到不同的 OBS "
+"命名空间中。相对归档布局也会在每个消费者自己的工作区下恢复，而不是生产者所在的绝对目录。生产者初始设置 "
+"`VLLM_ASCEND_BUILD_CACHE_DIR=csrc/build_cache`。Restore 通过 `GITHUB_ENV` "
+"导出其绝对等价路径以供编译使用，并在其 `cache-dir` 输出中保留原始写法。Save 使用该输出，而不是更新后的环境变量：将绝对构建目录作为 "
+"save 的输入会再次拆分 OBS 命名空间。restore/save "
+"传输失败仍然是非致命的；普通源码编译仍是回退方案。旧路径命名空间下的现有快照不会被迁移，因此使用共享路径的首次构建可能是冷构建。"
diff --git a/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/developer_guide/contribution/testing.po b/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/developer_guide/contribution/testing.po
