 "HIT/MISS/BYPASS，以确定源码构建是否真正复用了已编译的产物。有关标识与失败契约，请参阅[持久化 csrc "
 "构建缓存设计](../Design_Documents/persistent_csrc_build_cache.md)。"
+
+msgid "## PR testing requirements"
+msgstr "## PR 测试要求"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use this section when preparing or reviewing a pull request to decide which\n"
+"test coverage and validation evidence the change needs. See the preceding\n"
+"sections for environment setup and commands, and [E2E CI tests](e2e_ci_test.md)\n"
+"for PR CI."
+msgstr ""
+"在准备或审查拉取请求时，请使用本节内容来决定该变更需要哪些测试覆盖和验证证据。环境搭建和命令请参见前面的章节，PR CI 请参见 [E2E CI "
+"测试](e2e_ci_test.md)。"
+
+msgid "### Choose coverage for the change"
+msgstr "### 为变更选择合适的覆盖范围"
+
+msgid ""
+"Run the affected tests and required repository checks. Expand coverage when the\n"
+"change affects shared behavior, failures expose additional risks, or reviewers\n"
+"need more evidence. A full local test-suite run is not required for every change."
+msgstr ""
+"运行受影响的测试和必需的仓库检查。当变更影响共享行为、失败暴露出额外风险，或审查者需要更多证据时，请扩大覆盖范围。并非每次变更都需要在本地运行完整的测试套件。"
+
+msgid "| Change | Expected coverage |"
+msgstr "| 变更 | 预期覆盖范围 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| New behavior | Unit tests for the happy path, failure modes, and relevant "
+"boundary cases, such as empty input, single-element input, sequence-length "
+"limits, or overflow. |"
+msgstr "| 新行为 | 针对正常路径、失败模式以及相关边界情况（如空输入、单元素输入、序列长度限制或溢出）的单元测试。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Bug fix | A regression test that reproduces the original failure and "
+"passes with the fix. |"
+msgstr "| Bug 修复 | 一个能够复现原始失败、并在修复后通过的回归测试。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Integration behavior | Relevant E2E tests for the affected models, "
+"configuration, or distributed execution paths. |"
+msgstr "| 集成行为 | 针对受影响模型、配置或分布式执行路径的相关 E2E 测试。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| NPU performance path | Realistic hardware benchmarks and performance "
+"regression coverage, including memory use when affected. Add nightly "
+"coverage where appropriate. |"
+msgstr "| NPU 性能路径 | 贴近实际的硬件基准测试和性能回归覆盖，包括受影响时的内存使用情况。在适当情况下添加 nightly 覆盖。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Documentation or metadata | Focused checks such as Markdown linting, link "
+"validation, or parsing changed configuration. Add runtime tests when the "
+"change affects runtime behavior. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 文档或元数据 | 有针对性的检查，例如 Markdown 检查、链接校验或解析变更后的配置。当变更影响运行时行为时，添加运行时测试。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Unit tests live in `tests/ut/`, E2E tests in `tests/e2e/`, and nightly tests in\n"
+"`tests/e2e/nightly/`."
+msgstr ""
+"单元测试位于 `tests/ut/`，E2E 测试位于 `tests/e2e/`，nightly 测试位于\n"
+"`tests/e2e/nightly/`。"
+
+msgid "### Hardware and performance evidence"
+msgstr "### 硬件和性能证据"
+
+msgid ""
+"NPU-specific behavior requires validation on actual hardware before merge.\n"
+"Record the affected hardware, relevant software versions, model, configuration,\n"
+"commands, and results so reviewers can assess and reproduce the validation."
+msgstr ""
+"NPU 特有的行为需要在合并前于实际硬件上进行验证。请记录受影响的硬件、相关软件版本、模型、配置、命令和结果，以便审查者评估并复现验证过程。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If local hardware or dependencies are unavailable, continue preparing the PR\n"
+"with the checks that can run. Identify the remaining hardware checks for CI or\n"
+"reviewers; CPU mocks and static checks do not establish NPU correctness."
+msgstr ""
+"如果本地硬件或依赖不可用，请继续使用可运行的检查来准备 PR。请明确剩余需要由 CI 或审查者完成的硬件检查；CPU mock 和静态检查无法证明 "
+"NPU 的正确性。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For performance changes, compare the baseline and changed implementation under\n"
+"the same workload and environment. Include throughput or latency results and,\n"
+"when affected, memory use, fragmentation, and CPU-NPU synchronization behavior."
+msgstr ""
+"对于性能变更，请在相同的工作负载和环境下比较基线与变更后的实现。请包含吞吐量或延迟结果，并在受影响时包含内存使用、内存碎片以及 CPU-NPU "
+"同步行为。"
+
+msgid "### Report validation in the PR"
+msgstr "### 在 PR 中报告验证情况"
+
+msgid ""
+"Complete the PR template's **How was this patch tested?** section with:"
+msgstr "请填写 PR 模板中的 **How was this patch tested?** 部分，内容包括："
+
+msgid ""
+"- Tests added or updated, including relevant boundary cases.\n"
+"- Commands and observed results for local or manual checks.\n"
+"- CI jobs or hardware runs that provide additional evidence.\n"
+"- Failed, skipped, or unrun checks, the reason, and the validation still needed."
+msgstr ""
+"- 新增或更新的测试，包括相关边界情况。\n"
+"- 本地或手动检查的命令及观察到的结果。\n"
+"- 提供额外证据的 CI 任务或硬件运行。\n"
+"- 失败、跳过或未运行的检查，其原因，以及仍需进行的验证。"
+
+msgid ""
+"If no tests were added, explain which existing tests or focused checks cover\n"
+"the change, or why validation remains pending. Distinguish code inspection,\n"
+"CPU tests, NPU execution, and end-to-end validation when reporting results."
+msgstr ""
+"如果未添加测试，请说明哪些现有测试或有针对性的检查覆盖了该变更，或为什么验证仍待完成。在报告结果时，请区分代码审查、CPU 测试、NPU "
+"执行和端到端验证。"
+
+msgid "### PR submission checklist"
+msgstr "### PR 提交检查清单"
+
+msgid ""
+"- [ ] The title contains a change-type tag accepted by the [CI title check](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/pr_test.yaml#L59), such as `[BugFix]`, `[Feature]`, or `[Doc]`.\n"
+"- [ ] The applicable test coverage and validation results are recorded in the PR.\n"
+"- [ ] Required CI checks pass before merge.\n"
+"- [ ] Outstanding NPU hardware or performance validation is completed before merge."
+msgstr ""
+"- [ ] 标题包含 [CI 标题检查](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/.github/workflows/pr_test.yaml#L59) 所接受的变更类型标签，例如 `[BugFix]`、`[Feature]` 或 `[Doc]`。\n"
+"- [ ] 适用的测试覆盖和验证结果已记录在 PR 中。\n"
+"- [ ] 必需的 CI 检查在合并前通过。\n"
+"- [ ] 尚未完成的 NPU 硬件或性能验证在合并前完成。"
