+msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
+msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"
+
+msgid ""
+"You can use the official all-in-one vLLM Ascend Docker image. For 950DT "
+"Products, pull the A5 image that matches the current vLLM Ascend version:"
+msgstr ""
+"您可以使用官方的一体化 vLLM Ascend Docker 镜像。对于 Ascend 950DT系列产品，请拉取与当前 vLLM Ascend "
+"版本匹配的 A5 镜像："
+
+msgid ""
+"For other supported hardware and operating systems, select the corresponding"
