+"Follow the hardware-specific `docker run` command in the installation guide "
+"and mount the directory containing the Gemma4 weights into the container. "
+"The prebuilt image includes the matching CANN user-space environment, "
+"PyTorch, TorchNPU, vLLM, and vLLM Ascend versions."
+msgstr ""
+"对于其他支持的硬件和操作系统，请按照[使用预构建镜像](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
