+"Expected result: `npu-smi info` lists the expected Ascend devices, and both "
+"Python packages are installed."
+msgstr "预期结果：`npu-smi info` 列出预期的昇腾设备，并且两个 Python 包均已安装。"
+
+msgid "#### 950PR&950DT Products MXFP4 Quantized Models"
+msgstr "#### Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 MXFP4 量化模型"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following commands use TP4DP2 across all 8 NPUs on one 950DT Products "
+"node. The quantized checkpoints require `--quantization ascend`."
+msgstr ""
+"以下命令在一个 Ascend 950DT系列产品节点的全部 8 个 NPU 上使用 TP4DP2。量化权重需要指定 `--quantization "
+"ascend`。"
+
+msgid "=== \"31B Dense\""
+msgstr "=== \"31B 稠密\""
+
+msgid "=== \"26B A4B MoE\""
+msgstr "=== \"26B A4B MoE\""
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--tensor-parallel-size`: sets the tensor parallel size. Adjust it according to model size and available NPU devices.\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size`: sets the number of data parallel ranks. The MXFP4 examples use DP2 together with TP4 to use all 8 NPUs.\n"
+"- `--enable-expert-parallel`: enables expert parallelism for MoE variants when the deployment plan uses EP.\n"
+"- `--quantization ascend`: enables Ascend quantization. It is required for the two MXFP4 checkpoints listed in Section 3.1 and must be omitted for BF16 weights.\n"
+"- `--max-model-len`: sets the maximum input plus output length for a single request. Increase it only when enough KV cache is available.\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`: enables eager execution for baseline verification.\n"
+"- `--compilation-config`: configures graph execution. `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` can reduce decode-phase dispatch overhead, and `PIECEWISE` is also supported.\n"
+"- `--trust-remote-code`: allows vLLM to load model-specific code when required by the model repository."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--tensor-parallel-size`：设置张量并行大小。根据模型大小和可用 NPU 设备进行调整。\n"
+"- `--data-parallel-size`：设置数据并行 rank 的数量。MXFP4 示例使用 DP2 与 TP4 组合以使用全部 8 个 NPU。\n"
+"- `--enable-expert-parallel`：当部署方案使用 EP 时，为 MoE 变体启用专家并行。\n"
+"- `--quantization ascend`：启用昇腾量化。第 3.1 节中列出的两个 MXFP4 权重需要指定该参数，而 BF16 权重必须省略该参数。\n"
+"- `--max-model-len`：设置单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。仅在 KV cache 充足时才增大该值。\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`：启用 eager 执行以进行基线验证。\n"
+"- `--compilation-config`：配置图执行。`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 可以减少 decode 阶段的调度开销，同时也支持 `PIECEWISE`。\n"
+"- `--trust-remote-code`：当模型仓库要求时，允许 vLLM 加载模型特定的代码。"
+
+msgid "### 6.3 Multimodal Chat Completions API"
+msgstr "### 6.3 多模态对话补全 API"
