+"MXFP4 权重，并添加 `--quantization ascend`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| MXFP4 quantization | `--quantization ascend` | Reduces weight and "
+"activation memory and uses Ascend MXFP4 operators. | Required for the MXFP4 "
+"checkpoints; omit it for BF16 weights. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| MXFP4 量化 | `--quantization ascend` | 减少权重和激活内存，并使用昇腾 MXFP4 算子。 | MXFP4 "
+"权重需要指定该参数；BF16 权重则省略该参数。 |"
