 msgid ""
-">**Path description**: Download the model weights to a directory of your "
-"choice and record it. Ensure the model path in the subsequent deployment "
-"command matches this directory."
-msgstr ">**路径说明**：将模型权重下载到您选择的目录并记录该路径。确保后续部署命令中的模型路径与此目录一致。"
+"The validated Atlas 800 A2 deployment uses eight nodes with eight NPUs per "
+"node. Each node runs one DP rank and uses all eight local NPUs for tensor "
+"parallelism. Every DP rank handles both Prefill and Decode, resulting in a "
+"DP8/TP8/EP64 topology. Node 0 runs the API server and DP rank 0, while Nodes"
+" 1 through 7 run headless DP workers. This baseline serves the language "
+"model only."
+msgstr ""
+"经验证的 Atlas 800 A2 部署使用八个节点，每个节点配备八个 NPU。每个节点运行一个 DP rank，并使用全部八个本地 NPU "
+"进行张量并行。每个 DP rank 同时处理 Prefill 和 Decode，形成 DP8/TP8/EP64 拓扑。节点 0 运行 API 服务器和 "
+"DP rank 0，节点 1 至 7 运行无头 DP worker。此基线仅服务语言模型。"
 
-msgid "### 7.1 Using AISBench"
-msgstr "### 7.1 使用 AISBench"
+msgid ""
+"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
+"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
+"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 7 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
+"    - Assign a unique `DP_START_RANK` from `1` through `7` to each worker node.\n"
+"    - Ensure proxy bypass settings include all API and communication IP addresses used by the eight nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"- 将模型路径、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 DP RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
+"    - `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
+"    - 首先启动节点 0。节点 1 至 7 上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
+"    - 为每个 worker 节点分配一个从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一 `DP_START_RANK`。\n"
+"    - 确保代理绕过设置包含八个节点使用的所有 API 和通信 IP 地址。"
 
-msgid "### 7.2 Using Language Model Evaluation Harness"
-msgstr "### 7.2 使用 Language Model Evaluation Harness"
