-msgid "### 8.1 Using AISBench"
-msgstr "### 8.1 使用 AISBench"
+msgid ""
+"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
+"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to a unique value from `1` through `7`."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 worker 节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点的值，并将 `DP_START_RANK` "
+"设置为从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一值。"
 
-msgid "### 8.2 Using vLLM Benchmark"
-msgstr "### 8.2 使用 vLLM Benchmark"
+msgid ""
+"| Setting                      | Node 0       | Nodes 1-7"
+"                         | Description                                      "
+"|"
+msgstr ""
+"| 设置                      | 节点 0       | 节点 1-7                         | 说明"
+"                                      |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `LOCAL_IP`                   | Node 0 IP    | Current worker IP"
+"                 | Each node uses its own communication IP address. |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `LOCAL_IP`                   | 节点 0 IP    | 当前 worker IP"
+"                 | 每个节点使用自己的通信 IP 地址。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `NODE0_IP`                   | Not required | Node 0 IP"
+"                         | Workers use this address to join the DP group.   "
+"|"
