+
+msgid "Key A2 deployment parameters:"
+msgstr "A2 部署关键参数："
+
+msgid ""
+"| Parameter                      | Description"
+"                                                                     |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 参数                      | 说明"
+"                                                                     |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`     | Uses all eight NPUs in one A2 node "
+"for tensor parallelism.                      |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8`     | 使用单个 A2 节点中的全部八个 NPU 进行张量并行。"
+"                      |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--data-parallel-size 8`       | Creates eight global DP ranks across "
+"eight nodes.                               |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--data-parallel-size 8`       | 在八个节点上创建八个全局 DP rank。"
+"                               |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | Runs one DP rank on the current node."
+"                                           |"
+msgstr ""
+"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | 在当前节点上运行一个 DP rank。"
+"                                           |"
+
+msgid ""
+"    | `--language-model-only`        | Disables the multimodal encoder for "
