+"Index](https://link.gitcode.com/?target=https%3A%2F%2Fpypi.org%2F&from=https%3A%2F%2Fgitcode.com%2FAscend%2Fmemcache%2Fwiki%2FMMC%25E6%259C%2580%25E4%25BD%25B3%25E5%25AE%259E%25E8%25B7%25B5%25E2%2580%2594GLM-5.1%2BA3-4%25E6%259C%25BAPD%25E5%2588%2586%25E7%25A6%25BB.md&lang=zh&theme=white)"
+" 下载软件包并离线安装。如需安装未发布的版本，请按照 "
+"[官方安装指南](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/blob/master/doc/install_run.md)"
+" 从源码构建。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.2 Prepare the MemCache configuration files"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.2 准备 MemCache 配置文件"
+
+msgid ""
+"Select one node to run MetaService. On that node, replace the IP addresses "
+"in `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-meta.conf` with its service IP:"
+msgstr ""
+"选择其中一个节点运行 MetaService。在该节点上，将 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-meta.conf` 中的 IP "
+"地址替换为该节点的服务 IP："
+
+msgid ""
+"On every Prefill and Decode node, replace the IP addresses in "
+"`<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local.conf` with the same MetaService IP and "
+"confirm the following values:"
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上，将 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local.conf` 中的 IP "
+"地址替换为相同的 MetaService IP，并确认以下值："
+
+msgid ""
+"Use "
+"[`mem_scan.py`](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memfabric_hybrid/blob/master/src/smem/python/memfabric_hybrid/memfabric_hybrid/mem_scan.py)"
+" to determine the available memory on every node. Assuming the scan reports "
+"at least 600 GB of available memory, manually create "
+"`<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-local-standalone.conf` on every node with the "
+"following content. Replace `<META_SERVICE_IP>` with the MetaService node IP "
+"and change the DRAM capacity to values validated for that node:"
+msgstr ""
+"使用 "
+"[`mem_scan.py`](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memfabric_hybrid/blob/master/src/smem/python/memfabric_hybrid/memfabric_hybrid/mem_scan.py)"
+" 确定每个节点上的可用内存。假设扫描报告至少有 600 GB 可用内存，在每个节点上手动创建 `<MEMCACHE_CONFIG_DIR>/mmc-"
+"local-standalone.conf`，内容如下。将 `<META_SERVICE_IP>` 替换为 MetaService 节点 IP，并将 "
+"DRAM 容量改为该节点已验证的值："
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.3 Start MetaService"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.3 启动 MetaService"
+
+msgid ""
+"On the selected MetaService node, export the absolute path of `mmc-"
+"meta.conf` and start the metadata service:"
+msgstr "在选定的 MetaService 节点上，导出 `mmc-meta.conf` 的绝对路径并启动元数据服务："
+
+msgid ""
+"Keep this process running and ensure TCP ports `5000` and `6000` are "
+"reachable from every Prefill and Decode node. If the metrics endpoint is "
+"enabled, also make port `8000` reachable where required."
+msgstr ""
+"保持此进程运行，并确保每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点都能访问 TCP 端口 `5000` 和 "
+"`6000`。如果启用了指标端点，还需在需要的位置确保端口 `8000` 可访问。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.4 Start the standalone MemCache processes"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.4 启动独立 MemCache 进程"
+
+msgid "Create `memcache_standalone.py` on every Prefill and Decode node:"
+msgstr "在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上创建 `memcache_standalone.py`："
+
+msgid ""
+"Start one standalone process on every node with the standalone "
+"configuration:"
+msgstr "使用独立配置在每个节点上启动一个独立进程："
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait until every node prints `Successfully initialized MemCache.` before "
+"starting the vLLM engines."
+msgstr "等待每个节点打印 `Successfully initialized MemCache.` 后再启动 vLLM 引擎。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.5 Create the pooled vLLM engine templates"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.5 创建池化 vLLM 引擎模板"
+
+msgid ""
+"As in Section 5.2, the pooled Prefill and Decode templates require equal TP "
+"on both sides. Their connector TP sizes are taken from `$7`; the A3 pooled "
+"deployment below uses TP16."
+msgstr ""
+"与 5.2 节相同，池化 Prefill 和 Decode 模板要求两侧的 TP 相等。其连接器 TP 大小取自 `$7`；下面的 A3 池化部署使用 "
+"TP16。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` from Section 5.2 and create one engine template "
+"for each role. The fourth template argument is the global DP rank. The "
+"examples map Prefill ranks `0` through `3` to MemCache lookup RPC ports `0` "
+"through `3`, and Decode ranks `0` through `3` to lookup RPC ports `4` "
+"through `7`."
+msgstr ""
+"复用 5.2 节中的 `launch_online_dp.py`，并为每个角色创建一个引擎模板。第四个模板参数是全局 DP rank。示例将 "
+"Prefill rank `0` 到 `3` 映射到 MemCache 查找 RPC 端口 `0` 到 `3`，将 Decode rank `0` 到 "
+"`3` 映射到查找 RPC 端口 `4` 到 `7`。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.6 Start the pooled vLLM engines"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.6 启动池化 vLLM 引擎"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start MetaService first, then start and verify the standalone MemCache "
+"process on every node. After all standalone processes are ready, deploy "
+"`launch_online_dp.py` and save the corresponding Prefill or Decode engine "
+"template as `run_dp_template.sh` on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"先启动 MetaService，然后在每个节点上启动并验证独立 MemCache 进程。所有独立进程就绪后，部署 "
+"`launch_online_dp.py`，并在每个节点上将对应的 Prefill 或 Decode 引擎模板保存为 "
+"`run_dp_template.sh`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use the same launcher command for both groups. Replace the placeholders with"
+" the values for the local Prefill or Decode node:"
+msgstr "两组使用相同的启动命令。将占位符替换为本地 Prefill 或 Decode 节点的值："
+
+msgid "| Placeholder | Prefill group | Decode group |"
+msgstr "| Placeholder | Prefill group | Decode group |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `<LOCAL_DP_RANK>` | Local rank from `0` through `3` | Local rank from `0` "
+"through `3` |"
+msgstr "| `<LOCAL_DP_RANK>` | 本地 rank，范围从 `0` 到 `3` | 本地 rank，范围从 `0` 到 `3` |"
+
+msgid "| `<PD_MASTER_IP>` | Prefill master IP | Decode master IP |"
+msgstr "| `<PD_MASTER_IP>` | Prefill 主节点 IP | Decode 主节点 IP |"
+
+msgid "| `<DP_RPC_PORT>` | Prefill DP RPC port | Decode DP RPC port |"
+msgstr "| `<DP_RPC_PORT>` | Prefill DP RPC 端口 | Decode DP RPC 端口 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `<VLLM_START_PORT>` | Prefill node's starting service port | Decode node's"
+" starting service port |"
+msgstr "| `<VLLM_START_PORT>` | Prefill 节点的起始服务端口 | Decode 节点的起始服务端口 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"The command above is the A3 TP16 pooled example described in this section. "
+"Configure independent master addresses, RPC ports, and vLLM port ranges for "
+"the Prefill and Decode groups. Use the same TP on both sides; the launcher "
+"passes it to the engine template as `$7`."
+msgstr ""
+"上述命令是本节所述的 A3 TP16 池化示例。请为 Prefill 和 Decode 组分别配置独立的主节点地址、RPC 端口和 vLLM "
+"端口范围。两侧必须使用相同的 TP；启动器会将其作为 `$7` 传递给引擎模板。"
+
+msgid ""
+"After all engines are ready, start the load-balancing proxy as described in "
+"[PD Disaggregation with "
+"Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#start-the-"
+"service)."
+msgstr ""
+"所有引擎就绪后，按照 [使用 Mooncake 进行 PD "
+"分离](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#start-the-service) "
+"中所述启动负载均衡代理。"
+
+msgid "### 6.1 Mixed Deployment Functional Verification"
+msgstr "### 6.1 混合部署功能验证"
+
+msgid ""
+"After an 950DT Products mixed or PD service is ready, send a multimodal "
+"request to the API endpoint:"
+msgstr "Ascend 950DT系列产品混合部署或 PD 服务就绪后，向 API 端点发送多模态请求："
+
+msgid ""
+"The service should return HTTP 200 and a `choices` field containing the "
+"image description. The current implementation supports image inputs but does"
+" not support video inputs."
+msgstr "服务应返回 HTTP 200 以及包含图像描述的 `choices` 字段。当前实现支持图像输入，但不支持视频输入。"
+
+msgid ""
+"After an A3 mixed or PD service is ready, send a multimodal request to the "
+"API endpoint:"
+msgstr "A3 混合部署或 PD 服务就绪后，向 API 端点发送多模态请求："
+
+msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A2\""
+msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A2\""
+
+msgid ""
+"The validated A2 deployment uses `--language-model-only`. After all eight DP"
+" ranks are ready, send a text request to the Node 0 API endpoint:"
+msgstr ""
+"经验证的 A2 部署使用 `--language-model-only`。所有八个 DP rank 就绪后，向 Node 0 的 API "
+"端点发送文本请求："
+
+msgid ""
+"The service should return HTTP 200 and a `choices` field containing "
+"generated text. Nodes 1 through 7 are headless workers and do not accept "
+"HTTP requests directly."
+msgstr ""
+"服务应返回 HTTP 200 以及包含生成文本的 `choices` 字段。Node 1 到 Node 7 是无头工作节点，不直接接受 HTTP 请求。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`X-data-parallel-rank` is an optional HTTP request header that pins a "
+"request to a specific DP rank. Without this header, the internal vLLM load "
+"balancer on Node 0 selects an available rank. For this DP8 deployment, use "
+"an integer from `0` through `7` only when validating one rank, "
+"troubleshooting a worker, or testing rank-local prefix-cache behavior:"
+msgstr ""
+"`X-data-parallel-rank` 是一个可选的 HTTP 请求头，用于将请求固定到特定的 DP rank。若不设置该请求头，Node 0 "
+"上内部的 vLLM 负载均衡器会选择一个可用的 rank。对于此 DP8 部署，仅在验证单个 rank、排查工作节点问题或测试 rank "
+"本地前缀缓存行为时，才使用 `0` 到 `7` 之间的整数："
+
+msgid ""
+"Production traffic should normally omit this header so that requests remain "
+"balanced across all DP ranks. The request is always sent to the Node 0 API "
+"endpoint, even when a worker rank is selected."
+msgstr ""
+"生产流量通常应省略该请求头，以便请求在所有 DP rank 之间保持均衡。即使选择了某个工作 rank，请求也始终发送到 Node 0 的 API "
+"端点。"
+
+msgid "Here is one accuracy evaluation method for Kimi K3."
+msgstr "以下是 Kimi K3 的一种精度评估方法。"
+
+msgid "| dataset | version | metric | mode | vllm-api-general-chat | note |"
+msgstr "| dataset | version | metric | mode | vllm-api-general-chat | note |"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Refer to [Using "
+"AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md) for the "
+"environment setup and evaluation procedure."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 环境搭建和评估流程请参考 [使用 "
+"AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Run AISBench against the Kimi K3 service and collect the generated result"
+" files. Keep the model and tokenizer revisions, chat template, sampling "
+"settings, dataset, and evaluator revision fixed when comparing results."
+msgstr ""
+"2. 针对 Kimi K3 服务运行 AISBench 并收集生成的结果文件。在对比结果时，请保持模型和 tokenizer 版本、chat "
+"模板、采样设置、数据集以及评估器版本固定不变。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Refer to [Using AISBench for performance "
+"evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
+"performance-evaluation) for the environment setup and evaluation procedure."
+msgstr ""
+"环境搭建和评估流程请参考 [使用 AISBench "
+"进行性能评估](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-"
+"performance-evaluation)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use `vllm bench serve` to measure the online serving performance of the Kimi"
+" K3 service. The following is a minimal example for eight 128K-input, "
+"1K-output requests. Replace the service address, model path, dataset path, "
+"and result directory for the target environment."
+msgstr ""
+"使用 `vllm bench serve` 测量 Kimi K3 服务的在线服务性能。以下是一个针对八个 128K 输入、1K "
+"输出请求的最小示例。请根据目标环境替换服务地址、模型路径、数据集路径和结果目录。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Refer to [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for "
+"more details."
+msgstr ""
+"更多详情请参考 [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"
+
+msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
+msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"
+
+msgid ""
+"The recommended configurations are the same as those specified in [Chapter "
+"5, “Online Service Deployment”](#5-online-service-deployment)."
+msgstr "推荐配置与 [第 5 章“在线服务部署”](#5-online-service-deployment) 中指定的配置相同。"
+
+msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guide"
+msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use the validated deployment values above as a baseline. Adjust `max-model-"
+"len`, `max-num-seqs`, `max-num-batched-tokens`, and `gpu-memory-utilization`"
+" together for the target workload."
+msgstr ""
+"以上述经验证的部署值作为基线。针对目标工作负载，请协同调整 `max-model-len`、`max-num-seqs`、`max-num-"
+"batched-tokens` 和 `gpu-memory-utilization`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Refer to the [performance tuning "
+"guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)"
+" and the [feature matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)"
+" for additional guidance."
+msgstr ""
+"更多指导请参考 "
+"[性能调优指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)"
+" 和 [特性矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer to"
+" the [Public FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)."
+msgstr ""
+"关于常见的环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参考 [公共 "
+"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- **Q: Which multimodal inputs are supported by the current Kimi K3 implementation?**\n"
+"A: The current local processor accepts image inputs. Video inputs are not supported.\n"
+"- **Q: Which server options are required for Kimi K3 reasoning and tool calling?**\n"
+"A: Configure `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, `--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`, and `--tool-call-parser kimi_k3` together.\n"
+"- **Q: How should TP size be selected?**\n"
+"A: TP size must divide the checkpoint's attention-head count. It also affects KDA state layout and expert placement, so validate memory capacity and communication performance together.\n"
+"- **Q: How is DSpark enabled in PD separation?**\n"
+"A: Download `RadixArk/Kimi-K3-DSpark`, set `DRAFT_MODEL_PATH` on both Prefill and Decode nodes, and pass the same `--speculative-config` to both. Prefill must retain `--enforce-eager`."
+msgstr ""
+"- **问：当前 Kimi K3 实现支持哪些多模态输入？**\n"
+"答：当前的本地处理器接受图像输入。不支持视频输入。\n"
+"- **问：Kimi K3 的推理和工具调用需要哪些服务端选项？**\n"
+"答：需同时配置 `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice`、`--reasoning-parser kimi_k3` 和 `--tool-call-parser kimi_k3`。\n"
+"- **问：如何选择 TP 大小？**\n"
+"答：TP 大小必须能整除 checkpoint 的注意力头数量。它还会影响 KDA 状态布局和专家放置，因此需同时验证内存容量和通信性能。\n"
+"- **问：在 PD 分离中如何启用 DSpark？**\n"
+"答：下载 `RadixArk/Kimi-K3-DSpark`，在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上均设置 `DRAFT_MODEL_PATH`，并向两者传递相同的 `--speculative-config`。Prefill 必须保留 `--enforce-eager`。"
