+msgid ""
+"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
+" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
+"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
+"use in the production environment."
+msgstr ""
+"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
+"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
+" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
+msgstr ""
+"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
+"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
+" + vLLM-Ascend。**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The launch pattern is: prepare `launch_online_dp.py` and a role-specific "
+"`run_dp_template.sh` on each node, then start a load-balance proxy after "
+"every engine prints `Application startup complete`. The launcher below "
+"extends the repository example with `--pp-size`: on A3, Prefill uses `DP=1`,"
+" `TP=4`, and pipeline parallel (`PP=4`) with a `16,15,15,14` split of the 60"
+" transformer layers, while the 950DT products MXFP8 launch uses `PP=1` with "
+"`DP=2` on both roles. Each DP rank occupies `tp_size * pp_size` NPUs."
+msgstr ""
+"启动模式为：在每个节点上准备 `launch_online_dp.py` 和特定角色的 `run_dp_template.sh`，然后在每个引擎打印 "
+"`Application startup complete` 后启动负载均衡代理。下面的启动器在仓库示例的基础上扩展了 `--pp-size`：在 A3"
+" 上，Prefill 使用 `DP=1`、`TP=4` 和流水线并行（`PP=4`），将 60 个 transformer 层按 "
+"`16,15,15,14` 拆分；而 950DT 产品的 MXFP8 启动在两个角色上均使用 `PP=1` 和 `DP=2`。每个 DP rank 占用"
+" `tp_size * pp_size` 个 NPU。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This starts one Prefill API server on port `31050`. Wait until it prints "
+"`Application startup complete`."
+msgstr ""
+"这会在端口 `31050` 上启动一个 Prefill API 服务器。等待其打印 `Application startup complete`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To set up request forwarding, run the following script on a node that can "
+"reach every Prefill and Decode API port. You can get the proxy program in "
+"the repository's examples: "
+"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)."
+" For A3 1P1D, the proxy forwards requests to 1 Prefill rank and 4 Decode "
+"ranks."
+msgstr ""
+"要设置请求转发，请在能够访问所有 Prefill 和 Decode API 端口的节点上运行以下脚本。你可以在仓库的 examples "
+"中获取代理程序：[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
+"project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。对于"
+" A3 1P1D，代理将请求转发到 1 个 Prefill rank 和 4 个 Decode rank。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing. Follow the FLASHCOMM1 compatibility guidance in [Section 5.5](#55-multimodal-and-vit-dp-optional) when enabling this flag.\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size` (A3 Prefill: `4`): Splits the 60 MiniMax-M3 layers across four pipeline stages. A3 sets `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14` and also writes `pp_layer_partition` into the Mooncake extra config. With `TP=4`, use `DP=1` to fit all four stages on one 16-NPU node. The 950DT products launch uses `--pp-size 1` on both Prefill and Decode (no pipeline parallel), so no layer partition is needed.\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` (A3 Prefill: `8192`): For better prefill performance, use `8192` when the input length is at least 8192 tokens; for shorter inputs, set it to the input token length. This recommendation also applies to A3 Prefill with KV Cache Pool in Section 5.4.\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`: Prefill nodes do not capture CUDA/ACL graphs.\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`: Enables the `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` draft model. Do not replace this with GLM MTP options."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。启用此标志时，请遵循[第 5.5 节](#55-multimodal-and-vit-dp-optional)中的 FLASHCOMM1 兼容性指导。\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size`（A3 Prefill：`4`）：将 60 个 MiniMax-M3 层拆分到四个流水线阶段。A3 设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14`，并将 `pp_layer_partition` 写入 Mooncake 额外配置。在 `TP=4` 的情况下，使用 `DP=1` 可将全部四个阶段放在一个 16-NPU 节点上。950DT 产品的启动在 Prefill 和 Decode 上均使用 `--pp-size 1`（无流水线并行），因此无需层拆分。\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`（A3 Prefill：`8192`）：为获得更好的 prefill 性能，当输入长度至少为 8192 个 token 时使用 `8192`；对于更短的输入，将其设置为输入 token 长度。此建议同样适用于第 5.4 节中带 KV Cache Pool 的 A3 Prefill。\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`：Prefill 节点不捕获 CUDA/ACL 图。\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`：启用 `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` 草稿模型。请勿将其替换为 GLM MTP 选项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
+"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes.\n"
+"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer. Use different ports for prefill and decode. The verified values are A3 `36000`/`36100` and 950DT products `30000`/`26900`.\n"
+"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache.\n"
+"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"` (950DT products only): Required for UBOE / Ascend direct communication on 950DT products.\n"
+"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: `dp_size`, `tp_size`, and `pp_size` must match the actual global layout on both nodes. A3 uses `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4` and `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1`. 950DT products uses `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` and `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1`."
+msgstr ""
+"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 和 decode 节点之间的 KV cache 传输连接器。\n"
+"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：prefill 节点上为 `kv_producer`，decode 节点上为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
+"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV 传输端口。prefill 和 decode 使用不同的端口。已验证的值为 A3 `36000`/`36100` 和 950DT 产品 `30000`/`26900`。\n"
+"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为 KV cache 启用昇腾直接传输。\n"
+"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"`（仅 950DT 产品）：950DT 产品上 UBOE / 昇腾直接通信所需。\n"
+"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` 部分：`dp_size`、`tp_size` 和 `pp_size` 必须与两个节点上的实际全局布局匹配。A3 使用 `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4` 和 `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1`。950DT 产品使用 `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` 和 `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1`。"
+
